{"claims":[{"excerpt":"Uitgevouwen was Webb nog niet klaar voor routinewetenschap","claim":"Webb’s deployment did not mean it was ready for routine science.","category":"outcome","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Webb began its science mission and started to conduct routine science operations.","narrative":"De lezer moet vooral begrijpen dat uitgevouwen zijn een belangrijke mijlpaal was, niet het einde van Webbs weg naar wetenschappelijke operaties.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source distinguishes completion of deployment from the start of routine science operations after six months.","materiality":"Central to the piece’s main distinction."},{"excerpt":"Webb moest opgevouwen in de kuip van de Ariane 5-raket passen, want in zijn operationele configuratie was de telescoop daarvoor te groot.","claim":"Webb had to be folded to fit in the Ariane 5 fairing because its fully deployed operational configuration was too large to fit in an available rocket.","category":"cause","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Webb's fully deployed operational configuration is far too large to fit into any available rocket so it was designed to fold into a compact launch configuration that fit inside the Ariane 5.","narrative":"Webb was ontworpen om opgevouwen in de Ariane 5-kuip te passen.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The piece accurately conveys both the size constraint and the reason for the folded launch configuration.","materiality":"Provides context for why deployment was necessary."},{"excerpt":"De uitvouwing bestond uit veel stappen met mogelijke faalpunten en was daarmee een risicovolle fase.","claim":"Deployment involved many steps and possible failure points, making it a risky phase.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"There were over 50 major deployment steps, with 178 release mechanisms that had to perform perfectly or any one of over 300 single points of failure could have diminished or crippled the mission.","narrative":"De uitvouwing omvatte veel stappen en mogelijke faalpunten, waardoor duidelijk is dat dit een risicovolle fase was.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source documents numerous potential failure points and the serious consequences they could have had, supporting the characterization as risky.","materiality":"Conveys the stakes of deployment."},{"excerpt":"Ze verliep soepel.","claim":"Webb’s deployment proceeded smoothly.","category":"outcome","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Webb's deployment was completed with remarkable smoothness.","narrative":"de uitvouwing verliep soepel.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This closely matches the source’s description.","materiality":"Clarifies that the potential risks did not mean a failure occurred."},{"excerpt":"In de tweede week waren de spiegels uitgevouwen en vergrendeld","claim":"By the second week, Webb’s mirror structures had been unfolded and latched.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"During the second week after launch, we finished deploying the telescope structures by unfolding and latching the secondary mirror tripod and rotating and latching the two primary mirror wings.","narrative":"In de tweede week waren de spiegels uitgevouwen en vergrendeld","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The Dutch wording summarizes the unfolding and latching of the secondary mirror tripod and primary mirror wings.","materiality":"Identifies what was completed during the second week."},{"excerpt":"en had Webb zijn operationele configuratie bereikt.","claim":"Webb reached its fully deployed operational configuration in the second week.","category":"outcome","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"This brought Webb into its fully deployed operational configuration.","narrative":"had Webb zijn operationele configuratie bereikt.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This matches the source’s stated result of the second-week deployment.","materiality":"Marks the completion of deployment, distinct from readiness for routine science."},{"excerpt":"Dat was een belangrijke mijlpaal, maar betekende niet dat de telescoop al klaar was voor routinewetenschap.","claim":"Reaching the operational configuration was an important milestone, but did not mean Webb was ready for routine science.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"This brought Webb into its fully deployed operational configuration. ... After six months: “Science operations!” Webb began its science mission and started to conduct routine science operations.","narrative":"uitgevouwen zijn een belangrijke mijlpaal was, niet het einde van Webbs weg naar wetenschappelijke operaties.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source establishes the gap between completed deployment and routine operations; describing the deployment milestone as important is a fair characterization.","materiality":"Expresses the piece’s central distinction."},{"excerpt":"Tijdens de ingebruikname, die zes maanden duurde, volgden nog weken van afkoeling, maanden van spiegeluitlijning en daarna de kalibratie van de instrumenten.","claim":"During the six-month commissioning period, Webb underwent several weeks of cooling, months of mirror alignment, and then instrument calibration.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The telescope and scientific instruments started to cool rapidly in the shade of the sunshield, but it took several weeks for them to cool all the way down and reach stable temperatures. ... In the second, third and fourth months: Initial optics checkouts, and telescope alignment. ... In the fifth and sixth months: Calibration and completion of commissioning.","narrative":"afkoeling, spiegeluitlijning en instrumentkalibratie liepen door tijdens de ingebruikname van zes maanden.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source places cooling in the first month, alignment in months two through four, and calibration in months five and six. The piece’s sequence accurately summarizes those stages.","materiality":"Gives the timeline between deployment and science operations."},{"excerpt":"Na zes maanden begon Webb aan routinewetenschap.","claim":"Webb began routine science operations after six months.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"After six months: “Science operations!” Webb began its science mission and started to conduct routine science operations.","narrative":"Na zes maanden begon Webb aan routinewetenschap.","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This is directly stated in the source.","materiality":"Establishes when routine science began."}]}

